    Fix SSL_CTX_set1_sigalgs_list fuzzer.

    SSL_CTX_set1_sigalgs_list wants a NUL-terminated string, so we need to use
    GetString to give it one.

    Bug: oss-fuzz:9808
    Change-Id: Id7f676aa514c36de9dea900763db3cbbf5c79a4c
